<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</title>
<headline>Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian coffee region temperatures (centigrade) and rain (millimeters) in the 24 hours to 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Parana State: Londrina 20.8, maaringa 21.4, 43.5 mm, Umuarama 21.1, 3.2 mm, Paranavai 21.7, 2.7 mm.</p>
<p>Sao Paulo State: Presidente Prudente 22.0, 1.0 mm, Franca 19.2, 0.3 mm, Votuporanga 21.7,2.3 mm, Catanduva 21.1, 14.6 mm, Sao Carlos 19.0, 16.7 mm, Simao 20.4, 7.2 mm.</p>
<p>Minas Gerais State: Pocos de Caldas 19.0, 6.0 mm, Guaxupe 19.0, 2.0 mm.</p>
</text>
